{{also|adamsäpple}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{calque|en|fr|pomme d'Adam}}; so called from an idea that part of the forbidden fruit stuck in the Biblical Adam's throat.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Adam]]'s [[apple]]}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The [[lump]] in the [[throat]], usually more [[noticeable]] in [[men]] than in [[women]]; the [[laryngeal prominence]].
# {{taxlink|Tabernaemontana divaricata|species|noshow=1|ver=161006}}, a fragrant [[houseplant]] native to southeast Asia.
# A species of [[banana]], {{taxlink|Musa × paradisiaca|nothospecies|noshow=1|ver=161006}}.
# The [[citron]], ''[[Citrus limetta]]'', now ''[[Citrus medica]]''.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|anatomy}} {{l|en|laryngeal prominence}}
* {{sense|Tabernaemontana divaricata}} {{vern|crape jasmine}}, {{vern|pinwheel flower}}, {{vern|Nero's crown}}, {{vern|butterfly gardenia}}, {{vern|carnation of India}}, {{vern|East Indian rosebay}}, {{taxlink|Tabernaemontana coronaria|species|noshow=1|ver=161016}}, {{vern|coffee rose}}, {{vern|crepe gardenia}}

